{"steam_appid":3358250,"steam_name":"Loot of Baal","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3358250/1692523432/ffb9090536e1b3f44ccfb0ed1e219fcea603c0ef/1752050705/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752205882","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157413/8f533c008c8ccd4b80bdfa167e3998b726dde8d7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752205882","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/101114da804caee02579985ec4049ea070ee7cc4/ss_101114da804caee02579985ec4049ea070ee7cc4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/a4091db9139127e6f8578e2be0af7aaf0f99cdba/ss_a4091db9139127e6f8578e2be0af7aaf0f99cdba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/627d8fcf984a8d1c088226fdbcca655cb976d08c/ss_627d8fcf984a8d1c088226fdbcca655cb976d08c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/00d9e723dbed6c6cd70cdd5e9c05ea7bc1db65ce/ss_00d9e723dbed6c6cd70cdd5e9c05ea7bc1db65ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/7011177f071b0e934d2971e3b9ba36fe55e0291c/ss_7011177f071b0e934d2971e3b9ba36fe55e0291c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753929"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/b6c517bf95ba48e6a7ae615745ca7759.avif?t=1785753929\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Loot of Baal&quot; is an idle game nestled right on your screen's sidebar. Multitask your way to glory by sending your hireling crew out to explore, fight demons, and collect loot while you focus on other things! With hundreds of uniquely skilled hirelings, over 1000 distinct items, and a wealth of randomized battle stages, there’s always something to discover. Craft items and upgrade them to Immortal levels, and trade items online with other players to create the perfect team of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/21e747f127f4c962ab4780ec0af9b67f.poster.avif?t=1785753929\" width=800 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/21e747f127f4c962ab4780ec0af9b67f.webm?t=1785753929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/21e747f127f4c962ab4780ec0af9b67f.mp4?t=1785753929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/fcbad1a07ddc4632b44883dbac04724b.avif?t=1785753929\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your hireling crew from 5 distinctive classes—Mage, Paladin, Ranger, Berserker, and Necromancer—experiment with 72 unique skills, and gear up with over 400 Immortal items and 1000+ unique equipment pieces. Design creative combos to tackle diverse challenges—blast enemies with elemental magic, enchant weapons into mythical artifacts, or stack auras to bolster your team. Create your own unstoppable style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/308717ca87000814c6f4fbb0c8f87b0a.poster.avif?t=1785753929\" width=762 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/308717ca87000814c6f4fbb0c8f87b0a.webm?t=1785753929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/308717ca87000814c6f4fbb0c8f87b0a.mp4?t=1785753929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/8b378230efc949f5071400402c7186ac.avif?t=1785753929\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loot system is rich with randomness, offering a treasure pool with thousands of different affixes. Each drop is a surprise, combining random traits from this pool to create one-of-a-kind items. From magic to legendary and all the way to epic items, every discovery is a step closer to perfection. And chasing those maxed-out stats? That’s an endless journey in itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/0527825090d268fb7ccf268e203f3347.avif?t=1785753929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras_big/0527825090d268fb7ccf268e203f3347.avif?t=1785753929 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/ebce6abb55125b2ee553f72c6de613ce.avif?t=1785753929\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft over 200 unique equipment items to gear up your team for the journey ahead. Even basic gear can be game-changing thanks to built-in socket mechanics. Slot runes in the right order, and you’ll upgrade gear to Immortal levels, complete with unique effects. Plus, explore options like upgrading, socketing, unsocketing, and synthesizing for unmatched creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/16d2e423a3d4bae82062ba02f069df76.avif?t=1785753929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras_big/16d2e423a3d4bae82062ba02f069df76.avif?t=1785753929 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/1ad67afcb243e455cff058c75e0a4b42.avif?t=1785753929\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a perfect blend of classic and innovative gameplay! Not only can you recruit 5 iconic classes—Mage, Paladin, Ranger, Berserker ,and Necromancer—but the introduction of three-hireling crews takes strategy to a whole new level. Pick your crew wisely, balancing class traits, skill combos, and tactical demands. Together, tackle challenges, forge your legend, and begin an unforgettable adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/1521400e030fcbe198d343faf7b29081.poster.avif?t=1785753929\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/1521400e030fcbe198d343faf7b29081.webm?t=1785753929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358250/extras/1521400e030fcbe198d343faf7b29081.mp4?t=1785753929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10(64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I3-2100-3GHZ 2 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVDIA Geforce GTX-650 1GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10(64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5-4590 3.3GHZ 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVDIA Geforce GTX-1050Ti 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["Gleamer Studio"],"publishers":["Gleamer Studio","Gamersky Games"],"release_date":"16 Jun, 2025"}